 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2019-01-15",
   "text": "Protecting Domestic Violence and Stalking Victims Act of 2019\n This bill expands the categories of persons who are prohibited from receiving or possessing a firearm or ammunition.\n Specifically, it prohibits firearm sale or transfer to and receipt, possession, shipment, or transport by a person who has been convicted in any court of a misdemeanor crime of stalking."
  }
